Third-party material

This license covers the code and documentation written for this project. It
does not cover the material provided by the organizers of the GOSIM 2026
Agentic Observer Hackathon that is kept in this repository for reference:

- v3/kit/ (copy of the official starter kit) and v3/data/ (official starter
  kit archive, public scenario files and public leaderboard snapshots);
- v3/agents/*/protocol.py and the other protocol.py copies taken verbatim
  from the starter kit;
- scenario data produced by the official generators (v3/scenarios/);
- archived platform pages, rules and announcements (docs/en/, docs/zh/,
  docs/snapshots/, docs/announcements/, v3/runs/platform-2026-09-25/).

That material is licensed by the organizers under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/). Please cite the GOSIM 2026
Agentic Observer Hackathon (https://create.gosim.org/survey26/) when using it.
The evaluation engine itself is not included; it is fetched from
https://github.com/gosimfoundation/hackathon-survey26 at the commit pinned in
v4/evaluation/upstream.lock.json and is covered by that repository's license.
